name=LX Coop Fixes (split-screen stability, B42.21)
id=LX_CoopFixes
author=litoxperaloca
description=Fixes for B42.21 bugs that show up in split-screen. Stops the vehicle crash (BaseVehicle.update with a null chunk) that closes the game while driving. Gives player 2+ their own camera for aiming, so the green reticle, the aim ray and target tracking finally work for them instead of being computed from player 1's camera. Removes the stutter with the map or minimap open: the unexplored-area fog is uploaded to the GPU row by row instead of re-uploading the whole texture (64 MB on a modded world) every few seconds. Silences the error spam from IsoTree, LungeState and null textures. Recovers the Lock Picking XP that was being lost. Every patch is guarded: on any unexpected state it steps aside and the game runs vanilla. Requires ZombieBuddy. No loose class files.
modversion=1.2.0
versionMin=42.21
poster=poster.png
icon=icon.png
url=https://github.com/litoxperaloca/LX_CoopFixes
require=\ZombieBuddy
loadModAfter=\ZombieBuddy,\Cf_LockpickingSkill
javaJarFile=media/java/LXCoopFixes.jar
javaPkgName=lx.coopfixes
ZBVersionMin=2.3.0
